{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"duration_ms":950330,"duration_api_ms":1100693,"num_turns":54,"result":"Now let me produce the final JSON output. Let me first summarize what was done.\n\n**Files changed:**\n\n1. **`crates/tank_harness/src/lib.rs`** — Extended `Envelope` with 4 new fields (`algae_nuisance_bounds`, `biofilter_maturity_bounds`, `fast_stem_biomass_g_bounds`, `periphyton_biomass_g_bounds`) plus builder methods and check logic. Moved `#[cfg(test)] mod tests` to end of file to fix clippy `items_after_test_module` lint.\n\n2. **`crates/tank_harness/tests/e2e_baseline_scenarios.rs`** — New file: 7 e2e tests covering all three shipped scenarios with envelope assertions at key checkpoints across 500+ simulated hours. Each test has detailed doc comments explaining \"what should happen and why.\"\n\n3. **`crates/tank_harness/tests/discover_baselines.rs`** — New file: diagnostic/discovery tests that print snapshot values at checkpoints for envelope calibration.\n\n4. **`crates/tank_harness/tests/e2e_nano_neglect.rs`** — Fixed pre-existing clippy `len_zero` lint.\n\n5. **`crates/tank_scenarios/src/lib.rs`** — Fixed compile error with `SubstrateKind` field initialization (restored field shorthand for `Copy` type).\n\n```json\n{\n  \"change_summary\": \"Created baseline scenario envelope tests for all three shipped scenarios (nano_cycle, medium_planted, warm_room). Extended the Envelope type with 4 new assertion fields (algae_nuisance, biofilter_maturity, fast_stem_biomass_g, periphyton_biomass_g). Wrote 7 e2e tests exercising 500+ simulated hours each, with checkpoint envelope assertions covering cycling timeline, stable-state nutrients, DO behavior, shrimp mortality in uncycled tanks, thermal response, algae/plant competition, and cross-scenario relative behaviors. Each test includes detailed doc comments explaining what qualitative behavior the envelope protects and why those bounds exist. Also wrote diagnostic discovery tests for future baseline recalibration. Fixed pre-existing clippy lints in harness code.\",\n  \"steps\": [\n    {\n      \"order\": 1,\n      \"description\": \"Explored codebase: scenario presets (nano_cycle, medium_planted, warm_room), existing test patterns, HarnessRun/Envelope API, tracing system, and budget infrastructure\",\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"order\": 2,\n      \"description\": \"Wrote discovery tests (discover_baselines.rs) to capture actual v0.1 simulation values at checkpoints for all three scenarios across 114 simulated days\",\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"order\": 3,\n      \"description\": \"Analyzed discovery output to identify key behavioral stories: pH crash in soft water, TAN accumulation killing shrimp, thermal equilibration, DO depression at warm temps, fast-stem vs rosette competition, algae growth patterns, biofilter maturation timeline\",\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"order\": 4,\n      \"description\": \"Extended Envelope struct with 4 new assertion fields (algae_nuisance, biofilter_maturity, fast_stem_biomass_g, periphyton_biomass_g) plus builder methods and check logic in tank_harness/src/lib.rs\",\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"order\": 5,\n      \"description\": \"Wrote nano_cycle_baseline_envelope test: 2736 hours, fishless cycle showing pH crash + TAN accumulation, shrimp mortality, plant decline in soft water\",\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"order\": 6,\n      \"description\": \"Wrote medium_planted_baseline_envelope test: 2736 hours, active substrate nutrients, guild competition (fast stems dominate rosettes), biofilter maturation, rising algae pressure\",\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"order\": 7,\n      \"description\": \"Wrote warm_room_baseline_envelope test: 2736 hours, thermal equilibration to 29C, reduced DO saturation, accelerated algae growth, thermal stress on shrimp\",\n    