rtions at multiple checkpoints\",\n    \"Each baseline test produces CI-friendly exit codes (0 = pass, non-zero = envelope violation) and supports TANK_E2E_VERBOSE=1 for full trace dumps\",\n    \"Envelope bounds are scientifically motivated with doc-comment explanations of 'what should happen and why' for each constraint\"\n  ],\n  \"outstanding_risks\": [\n    \"Envelope bounds are intentionally wide to survive parameter tuning — they catch gross regressions but may not detect subtle behavioral changes. Downstream bead tanksim-6e5.7.3 should tighten these with literature-backed values.\",\n    \"All three baseline scenarios result in shrimp mortality (TAN too high in uncycled tanks). A 'well-maintained' scenario with properly seeded biofilter would be needed to exercise shrimp reproduction envelopes — this is deferred to tanksim-6e5.6.6.\",\n    \"The discover_baselines.rs test is a diagnostic tool that prints to stderr — it should be excluded from CI if output volume is a concern (no assertions, always passes).\",\n    \"Cross-scenario tests compare relative behaviors but don't assert absolute magnitudes — future phases should add quantitative cross-checks as the model matures.\"\n  ]\n}\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"92116f67-cb24-4a2e-989d-aaa400182d26","total_cost_usd":5.001806200000001,"usage":{"input_tokens":48,"cache_creation_input_tokens":147114,"cache_read_input_tokens":5362960,"output_tokens":27794,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":147114,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":9685,"outputTokens":23202,"cacheReadInputTokens":3003012,"cacheCreationInputTokens":223822,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.7057737000000001,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":48,"outputTokens":27794,"cacheReadInputT